 "notes": [
  {
   "kind": "function",
   "text": "The 007786 is a sprite frame buffer controller.\nIt works in two modes:\n- When SEL = 0, it generates addresses for the frame buffer.\n- When SEL = 1, it parses sprite character data\nIt also handles refreshing of data in the DRAM memory.\n\nThe 007786 uses an OKI 74V000 CMOS gate array\nwith 2400 unit cells."
  }
 ],
